Please check the phone top bar, a long reply, and an expanded **Chat Settings** drawer in day and night; a screenshot will let us catch remaining rendering issues.

References: `docs/appearance/theme-author-guide.md` — “Hooks”; `docs/appearance/custom-css-themes.md` — “Styling chat windows and drawers.”

